{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-470ae17ed88241d7a66c4d69445ab09872a00b38b1134095","family_id":"KR:002619","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Decree of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법 시행령","kind":"대통령령","source_version":"288439","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=288439","source_sha256":"6fddccc8dd40d065ba4af293d38ee89d2ecaf5b6b4ebb45961fc19ab8c83311e","body_sha256":"972173c729fc67dbee16a84b95fc9d94d975ec9cfaca5e747e13bed737bdedb0","article_count":0,"full_text":"The Decree Partially Amending the Enforcement Decree of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act, which has undergone deliberation by the State Council, is hereby promulgated.\n\nPresident Lee Jae-myung (seal)\nJuly 30, 2026\nPrime Minister Han Seong-suk\nState Council Member and Minister of Finance and Economy Gu Yun-cheol\n\nPresidential Decree No. 36544\nDecree Partially Amending the Enforcement Decree of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act\n\nThe Enforcement Decree of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act is partially amended as follows:\n\nIn the proviso to subparagraph 1 of Article 3-2 and the proviso to subparagraph 2 of that Article, each occurrence of \"July 31, 2026\" is replaced by \"September 30, 2026\".\n\nADDENDUM\nThis Decree shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation.\n\n[Partial Amendment]\nReasons for Amendment and Main Contents\n\nTo ease the public's fuel-cost burden, the duration of the temporary reduction of elastic traffic, energy and environment tax rates for gasoline, diesel and substitute fuels similar thereto is extended by two months, from \"until July 31, 2026\" to \"until September 30, 2026\".\n\n<Provided by the Ministry of Government Legislation>\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\5a9c7cc8d2dec8b3ac9f51aa7b9fc81562f31c081be5429d09c77f104c2f1d46.ascii.json","sha256":"5a9c7cc8d2dec8b3ac9f51aa7b9fc81562f31c081be5429d09c77f104c2f1d46"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_component_text_sha256":"1667f34ecc60f4b6cec5560ad7bf9b5152d7cdeba8fcb0966880fc07f3bb25ca","unit_key":"amendment-text"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"4a60c1c00c5341f03cb5fd65c3d015c110ba2a2f48a9589ddefba40f376c309e","unit_key":"enactment-amendment-reason"}],"source_component_text_sha256":"1667f34ecc60f4b6cec5560ad7bf9b5152d7cdeba8fcb0966880fc07f3bb25ca","source_law_id":"kr-002619-288439-ko","source_review_complete":true,"source_xml_sha256":"6fddccc8dd40d065ba4af293d38ee89d2ecaf5b6b4ebb45961fc19ab8c83311e","target_body_sha256":"b75f2b0628e803370822397ef8d765bff5392a0b41c6dfd6062781b5c57f6c9b","unit_key":"amendment-text"},"unit_key":"amendment-text"},{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\5a9c7cc8d2dec8b3ac9f51aa7b9fc81562f31c081be5429d09c77f104c2f1d46.ascii.json","sha256":"5a9c7cc8d2dec8b3ac9f51aa7b9fc81562f31c081be5429d09c77f104c2f1d46"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_component_text_sha256":"1667f34ecc60f4b6cec5560ad7bf9b5152d7cdeba8fcb0966880fc07f3bb25ca","unit_key":"amendment-text"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"4a60c1c00c5341f03cb5fd65c3d015c110ba2a2f48a9589ddefba40f376c309e","unit_key":"enactment-amendment-reason"}],"source_component_t